WEBVTT

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.840
Take this!

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.360
What are you doing?

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.940
Monster, get out of this village!

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.390
I'm no monster.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.860
What's going on?

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.960
Stop it.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.890
Come on, let's go!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.860
Takashiro...

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.660
Yomi...

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.540
Are you all right?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.550
I didn't ask for help.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.750
What are you talking about?
You're injured.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.360
I'd hardly call this an injury.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.800
Hold still.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:15.190
This sakura tree simply refuses to bloom.

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:16.850
Someday, it will bloom.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.290
You're right.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:24.160
Even the slightest damage will
cause the fragile sakura to wilt.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:29.360
I'd like to see what kind of
flowers you'll grow, Reiga.

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:39.630
Only I know your pain...

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.130
Your uncertainty...

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.470
Your loneliness...

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.300
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:56.610
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.830
I will not betray you!

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:54.010
<i>More than a thousand years ago,</i>

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:58.360
<i>during the Heian era,</i>

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:07.190
<i>the Giou Clan lived quietly, within the barrier
we erected around the mountains.</i>

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.370
Reiga.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:14.200
I heard the court issued a request.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.170
Yes.

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.910
It's getting cold.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.310
I'll give you the details along the way.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:36.340
Sakura

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.460
A shaman in the capital

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.660
unwisely summoned some
high-ranking demons.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:44.810
High-ranking?

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.090
How are things in the capital?

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:50.360
Evidently, it isn't merely one or two.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.560
And so, the court has requested
the Giou Clan's aid.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:58.420
Yes. Not even the court monks
could handle the situation.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.110
I'm glad to see you well.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.860
I am, thank you.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.700
It's another beautiful day.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.460
Please return to your work.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.110
Yes, Takashiro-sama.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.650
Thank you for your consideration.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:15.900
Honey, look...

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:19.320
R-Reiga-sama...

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:21.650
P-Please excuse me.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.160
Don't mind them.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.700
They're back. Open the gate.

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.570
Yes, sir!

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.540
Demon slaying again...

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.850
We're always cleaning up
after someone else.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.840
Don't say that, Reiga.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.300
Yomi.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:21.160
I heard the capital's situation is quite dire.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.190
I wonder if they're okay.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:28.750
I will go.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.620
I've already agreed to handle the matter,

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:35.710
with a few trained demon slayers.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:41.450
Reiga, I need you to stay here
and protect the village.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.420
I'm counting on you.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:52.600
<i>For generations, the Giou Clan
had protected the court from demons.</i>

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:01.450
<i>At the time, the Giou Clan was led by
those known as the Four Saints,</i>

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:03.400
<i>who were chosen for their abilities.</i>

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:07.190
<i>Giou Ario was the supreme leader.</i>

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:11.120
<i>After him came myself, Yomi,</i>

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.210
<i>and Reiga...</i>

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:29.250
It seems, some in the village
fear Reiga's power.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:33.310
People fear that which they
do not understand.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:37.960
I'm extremely concerned about Reiga.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.160
About Reiga?

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:43.850
I'm worried Reiga won't know
what to do with such power.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.990
That would never be the case with Reiga.

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:52.640
Let us hope it is only my imagination.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.160
What was that?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.420
Reiga?

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.020
Yes. Don't worry.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.680
I'll go talk to him.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:37.760
Is my blood tainted, Takashiro?

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.350
Yomi is simply concerned about you.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:45.540
I am just like this sakura.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.040
A sakura that cannot bloom
is no sakura at all.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.960
That sakura will bloom this year.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.310
Is that meant to comfort me?

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:00.220
It's the truth.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:04.520
Look carefully.
The buds are beginning to swell.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.380
When did that happen?

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.450
They're the fruits of your labor.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:26.300
I'll have to finish this job quickly,
so I can return in time to see the flowers.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:46.340
Take care of things while I'm
gone, Reiga and Yomi.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.670
Leave it to us.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.100
Be careful.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.740
I'll be back.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.740
Takashiro.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:56.660
What is it, Yomi?

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.840
I... Nothing.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.160
Take care of yourself.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.910
I'll be back soon.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.130
The sakura has bloomed,

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.660
but there's still no word from Takashiro?

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:47.100
No...

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.190
This wasn't easy.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.370
How's the damage over there?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:10.720
Hardly any at all.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.190
I see. Good work, everyone.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.130
Let's go home.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:16.230
Yes, sir!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.470
That's...

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.830
Wh-What is this?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.320
Hello? Is anyone here?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.860
If you're alive, answer me!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.370
Takashiro-sama...

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.520
Hold on!

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:09.600
What happened?

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:13.800
A h-horde of demons...

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:15.720
What happened to the barrier?

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:18.060
R-Reiga-sama...

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:22.840
Reiga?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:43.970
Yomi...

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.620
<i>What I found there was darkness.</i>

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.770
<i>All-consuming darkness.</i>

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.230
Reiga...

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:16.400
Did you do this?

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.700
Wait! Reiga!

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.650
You were too late.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.830
It was all too late.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.430
Yomi...

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:54.830
<i>Yomi!</i>

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:10.470
Reiga killed half the villagers
and disappeared.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.570
What about Ario?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.870
Now that I'm thinking on it,

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:24.600
there was something dangerous
about Reiga, just as Yomi said.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:27.680
I misjudged him.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:32.680
I thought he could be trusted.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.600
And because of it, many died.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.570
I will kill Reiga,

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:44.200
to put an end to all of this.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.580
Yuki-kun sure is taking a long time...

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.550
Perhaps he's still shaken up.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:11.200
Yuki-kun.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.550
Were you waiting for me?

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.320
Of course.

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:25.600
Did Takashiro-sama tell you everything?

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:26.860
Yes.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.170
What are you going to do now?

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.280
What will I do?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.410
I want to know what you really feel.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.360
What I really feel...

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.330
You're kind, so I know you'll
do what's asked.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:43.610
But I'm not sure you should
have joined the Giou Clan.

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:44.340
Tsubaki...

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.340
Think about it!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.640
We're here by choice.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:53.030
Fighting Duras... Defeating Reiga...

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:55.930
We know that's what we're meant to do.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.100
But Yuki is different!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.860
He came here, with no
memories of his past.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.720
And he should make his own decision,

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:06.240
now that he understands what
this battle is about!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:09.230
His future... What he wants to do!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.600
I...

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:21.570
I don't want any more people to get hurt.

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:29.220
So I will fight, if that's something I can do.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.890
This won't be good.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:41.120
Are you sure this is what you want?

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.900
It won't be easy for Yuki,

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:51.340
but if he chooses not to fight,
he won't be able to see it through.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.010
Excuse me.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:05.960
What?

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.600
Tsubaki-san and Ibuki-san...

00:17:09.390 --> 00:17:11.470
Are you my aunts?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.580
Did Takashiro-sama tell you?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:18.520
Yes, I heard you are my mother's sisters.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.720
Since the boss has already
explained he's not your brother,

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.640
I suppose we can tell you
about Mizuki-san now.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.090
Mizuki?

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.390
It's your mother's name.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.690
I'm sorry we didn't tell you.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:38.990
We'd been wanting to meet
you and tell you...

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:41.660
You're our precious nephew.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:45.770
Yuki-kun, here.

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:54.180
My mother...

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.580
She's beautiful!

00:17:56.580 --> 00:18:00.870
When we took that photo,
you were growing inside her.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.640
Our sister had you when she was nineteen.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:08.430
What about my father?

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.330
Well...

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.370
Mizuki refused to tell us his name.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:23.450
One day, she took you and disappeared.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.000
But remember this.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:38.390
Mizuki didn't leave you at the orphanage
because she didn't want you.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:42.130
I think she wanted to protect you.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:47.620
Mizuki treasured you,
even before you were born.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:58.620
Never forget that someone
wanted you to be born.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:01.120
Someone wanted me...

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:08.310
We, also, were delighted
when you were born.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:10.670
It was as though we had
a new little brother.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.560
Aren't you guys going to sleep?

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.450
I'm not tired.

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:36.370
Not that I feel like doing anything...

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:39.160
You two should get some sleep.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:44.890
It's like the lights inside the
house have gone out,

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.610
having Yuki gone.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.840
I wish I had followed Yuki-chan, after all.

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:58.580
You know Takashiro-sama's
orders are absolute.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:19:59.800
I know, but...

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:05.480
Hey, Takashiro told him he's not
actually his brother, right?

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:09.000
How did Yuki respond to that?

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:13.270
I don't know. When I spoke with
Tachibana-san on the phone,

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:17.280
Takashiro-sama still wasn't
done talking to him.

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:19.120
I'm curious, as well.

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:22.740
After all, we've been lying to Yuki, too.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.990
We weren't lying to him!

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:26.750
We just didn't say anything!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.340
It's the same thing.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:34.040
Do you think Yuki-chan will forgive us?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.330
Don't cry, Toko-chan.
We'll apologize, too.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:38.490
Tsukumo...

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.430
Damn it!

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:55.600
<i>For the Zweilts, it's bliss to receive love
or orders from their master, Yuki.</i>

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:01.240
<i>I guess that's karma.</i>

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.170
Luka-kun.

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:14.080
Is Takashiro done talking to Yuki?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.250
Yes.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.600
Yuki-kun made his decision.

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:23.740
I see.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:43.880
I've always thought of myself as unwanted,

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:47.020
but someone wanted me to be born.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:53.200
Sodom, what do you think
your master's up to?

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:01.980
Why do I long to see Luka?

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:40.190
Sodom? Are you washing the dishes today?

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:43.670
That's amazing. You cleaned
them all in a flash.

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:45.860
Sodom! Don't shake yourself!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:47.370
A World Without You

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:48.860
We need to dry you off!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:49.690
A World Without You
